      pilotNote: 'Foundation pilot only: 400 original selected-response items, eight structured unit lessons, and internal remediation routes. This remains an internal enhancement pass; do not treat it as a 500-item release candidate until content, rights, accessibility, and subject-expert gates advance.',
      bigIdeas,
